/-!
# A102009

Indices of primes in sequence defined by A(0) = 13, A(n) = 10*A(n-1) - 7 for n > 0.

The 12 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A102009

